{
  "_comment": [
    "Built-in application catalog. Each entry pairs an app's process identity",
    "with the full set of backend domains it needs \u2014 the 'domain bundle'.",
    "Blocking only the front door (chatgpt.com) leaves an installed desktop",
    "client working because it talks to the API, auth and telemetry hosts",
    "instead; blocking the bundle is what actually makes the installed app",
    "useless. Domains are matched with subdomain suffix semantics by the agent,",
    "so 'openai.com' covers 'api.openai.com'."
  ],
